<PageTitle>Blazor Web Vitals spike</PageTitle>

<h1>Blazor Web Vitals spike</h1>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/static">Static SSR</a>: no interactivity (baseline)</li>
    <li><a href="/wasm">WebAssembly, prerendered, persisted state</a>: the candidate</li>
    <li><a href="/wasm-nopersist">WebAssembly, prerendered, refetch on start</a></li>
    <li><a href="/wasm-noprerender">WebAssembly only</a></li>
    <li><a href="/server">Interactive Server</a>: one circuit per tab</li>
    <li><a href="/auto">Interactive Auto</a>: a circuit until WebAssembly is cached, then WebAssembly</li>
    <li><a href="/islands">Static SSR with a JavaScript island</a>: no circuit, no WebAssembly</li>
</ul>
